WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.930
Every frame of this video was made in code, by Claude.

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.750
It starts from a brief in numbers, not adjectives.

3
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.310
Premium becomes a spring that barely bounces.

4
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.560
One skill makes app walkthroughs,

5
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.880
diagrams that explain an idea,

6
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.330
3D objects, and loops that land on the beat.

7
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.580
Change the style pack,

8
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.460
and the same story is printed,

9
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.030
pixelated, or cut from paper.

10
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.360
It writes the script, records the voice,

11
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:35.010
and times every move to the words.

12
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:38.100
Then it reviews its own frames,

13
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.470
like an animator.

14
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.900
Contact sheets.

15
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.110
Onion skins.

16
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.540
Speed graphs.

17
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.350
And a test for every number in the brief.

18
00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.280
It's free and open source.

19
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.960
Install it with one line,

20
00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.250
and make your own.
